OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be cloudy with outbreaks of rain.
OL,7,FThen the rest of the night will be
OL,8,Fcloudy with further outbreaks of rain,
OL,9,Fturning heavy at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FCloudy with persistent and
OL,12,Foccasionally heavy rain spreading
OL,13,Fnorth in the morning. Further showery
OL,14,Frain in the afternoon, occasionally
OL,15,Fheavy with a chance of thunder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
