OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FUnsettled on Wednesday with showers or
OL,7,Flonger spells of rain, often heavy at
OL,8,Ftimes. Brighter on Thursday with a few
OL,9,Fshowers. Showery rain from the west on
OL,10,FFriday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
